        "date": "2026-02-16T22:18:10Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(data): add operation() IDL for Zawrs wrs.nto and wrs.sto instructions\n\nAdd the missing operation() implementations for the two Zawrs\nwait-on-reservation-set instructions.\n\nwrs.nto (no timeout):\n- Checks mstatus.TW: traps with IllegalInstruction in any mode\n  other than M when TW=1\n- Checks hstatus.VTW: traps with VirtualInstruction in VS/VU mode\n  when TW=0 and VTW=1\n- Unlike WFI, does NOT trap in U-mode when TW=0\n- Delegates the actual wait to the wrs_nto() builtin\n\nwrs.sto (short timeout):\n- No TW/VTW checks needed since the built-in timeout guarantees\n  forward progress\n- Delegates to the wrs_sto() builtin\n\nAlso adds wrs_nto and wrs_sto as builtin functions in\nbuiltin_functions.idl, following the same pattern as the existing\nwfi builtin (a valid implementation is a no-op).",
