      "message": "fix(iss): add wrs_nto and wrs_sto builtin implementations to C++ ISS\n\nThe builtin functions were declared in IDL but had no C++ implementation\nin the Hart class, causing compilation failures in the riscv-tests CI.\nBoth are implemented as no-ops, which is a valid implementation per the\nZawrs specification.",
